#
# Counter-example for math:TheoremGroundingShape: a math:Theorem with a theory context
# (math:roleInTheory) but NEITHER an in-graph math:Proof (nothing math:provesStatement it)
# NOR a declared math:externalWarrant — theorem-hood asserted with no warrant, a truth bit.
# It fails the sh:sparql proof-or-warrant constraint, so validation MUST emit
# shacl.SPARQLConstraintComponent and NO other finding (math:UngroundedTheoremClaim).
# Bound by ex:ecTheoremUnwarranted.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:unwarrantedTheorem a math:Theorem ;
    math:roleInTheory ex:euclideanGeometryV2 .
